    "description": {
      "value": "You dance, Striding up to half your Speed. At either the start or end of your Stride, you create an area of magical darkness in a 10-foot burst centered on your location. This area is filled with magical darkness that works the same way as that created by a darkness spell of the same level. When you create the darkness, attempt a Performance check to dance, with a standard DC for your level, to determine the duration of the darkness.\n\n- **Critical Success:** 1 minute\n- **Success:** 2 rounds\n- **Failure:** 1 round"
